WEBVTT

00:01:58.050 --> 00:01:59.720
That's a royal teardrop.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.220
Ayeka.

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:10.900
For you, Yosho.

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:16.490
Why are you
out here alone?

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:20.660
Because you went out,
leaving me behind.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.250
One day,...

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:31.670
I will be your bride,
won't I?

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:34.420
When you grow up.

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:37.420
It is the color
of your eyes.

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:39.760
A royal teardrop?

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.560
What's wrong?

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:51.520
This flower shouldn't be
used for happy occasions.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:08.620
You...

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:10.000
Devil!

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:11.790
Yosho.

00:03:12.130 --> 00:03:13.920
Wait. Take me with you!

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:16.380
Yosho.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:27.430
Yosho, where are you?

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:37.650
Yosho?

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.150
He's died long ago.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:40.110
What?

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:43.320
I will return this.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.870
A keepsake for you.

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:58.920
Oh, no!

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:11.850
He isn't dead.

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.020
He can't be.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:26.160
I wish I could go home
to planet Jurai.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:27.240
Huh?

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:30.160
What's she up to so early?

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.370
What a disgusting thing
to see...

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:34.330
first thing
in the morning.

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:36.000
That monster woman.

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.090
Let's see.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:58.980
Episode #3
HELLO RYO-OHKI

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:03.320
Come on, Ayeka.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:06.820
No. I don't want to!

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:08.530
Ayeka,

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:13.200
you've stayed in this room
one whole week.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.920
They're going to think
that we Juraians...

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:18.580
don't even have the courtesy
to say hello.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.170
No, they won't.

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:26.130
But the head of the family
is out now, isn't he?

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:30.640
The father may be out,
but Tenchi is at home.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:34.100
Ayeka, this is
very hard on me.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.730
I'm sorry, Sasami.

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:40.480
I should be the one to
worry about these things.

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:47.110
Let's go.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:03.550
How unpleasant.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.970
Ayeka.

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:12.510
Well, look who's here.

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:14.060
It's been so long...

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:16.390
that I was beginning
to think you'd died.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.100
Where is Tenchi?

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.150
Tenchi?

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:21.060
Well, he isn't here
for sure.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:24.320
I worked so hard to get
Ayeka out here.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:25.280
Hey.

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:29.450
What have you got there?
What is it?

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:30.570
You want to know?

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:31.240
Yes.

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.830
It was born this morning.

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:37.200
Isn't it adorable?

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:38.710
Did you lay it?

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.540
Sasami, don't touch!

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:44.340
Ayeka.

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:48.340
Ah, please allow me to
express my gratitude...

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:51.220
for your hospitality
to the Jurai Royal Family.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:56.430
Anyway, thank you
very much.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:00.190
Huh? Yeah, sure.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:04.230
Hey, Princess, don't you
want to know about this egg?

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:07.610
l have no intention of
listening to your insults.

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.650
What are you doing, Sasami?

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:11.660
You'll get germs from that.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:14.580
But Ryoko's baby
is going to be born,...

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.950
and that's definitely
something I want to see.

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.750
So, you are married,
aren't you?

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.540
Who is the father?

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:22.580
Sasami!

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:23.920
See?

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.840
Eh? Tenchi?

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:33.720
Huh? What? Ayeka,
are you all right now?

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.970
That is certainly
none of your business.

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.850
Why don't you
just go over there...

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.680
and hold that egg
with your monster woman?

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.560
Egg? What are you
talking about?

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:47.110
I'm so happy to be bearing
a child of the man I love.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.480
A child?

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:49.820
Hold it tight.

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.030
It won't be long.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:54.870
Huh? I don't understand.

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:18.260
Come here,
a good little Ryo-Ohki.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:19.680
Ryo-Ohki?

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:20.890
Your spaceship?

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:23.020
Then that's
the child of...

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:26.440
Ryo-Ohki?

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:29.400
Yeah, this is
Ryo-Ohki's child.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.440
Can a spaceship
have a baby?

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.610
Sure. My ship
was totally destroyed,...

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:35.410
so it reproduced itself.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:38.410
You must be crazy to think
it's Tenchi's child.

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:40.950
Yeah, I thought
that was kind of strange.

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:44.830
This is so typical.
You're all making fun of me.

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.040
Uh, Ayeka,...

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.500
We're not making
fun of you.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.630
At least I'm not.

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:52.340
Let go, you cad.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.890
I thought
you were different.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:59.310
Why don't you go have a good
time with your fossil woman.

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:04.730
Oops.

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.730
I beg your pardon.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:12.320
Is something the matter, Miss?

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:19.990
No.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:22.660
Nothing really.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:55.320
That princess has a knack
for curing my boredom.

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:58.110
What kind of mischief
are you up to now?

00:09:58.110 --> 00:10:00.570
Don't you have
any conscience at all?

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:03.540
You are just so sweet.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:09.960
You're so sweet to be
so concerned about me.

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:11.170
Whoa.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.300
Tenchi, where is the sword?

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.800
I gave it back to Ayeka.

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:17.090
You what?

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:20.590
But that sword contains
all of my energy source.

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:23.470
What if she uses it?

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:29.730
Oh, second time today.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:32.060
I guess I'm lucky.

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:34.070
Grandpa, when did you--

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:37.190
What are you doing,
dirty old man?

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:40.410
What a spry young lady
we've got here.

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:42.450
Huh?

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:47.370
Now then, this is
Tenchi's baby, is it?

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:49.330
No, Grandpa.

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.580
This is Ryo-Ohki.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.920
She just hatched
from an egg.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.090
I see, I see.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.880
Tenchi, now that you are
a father of a child...

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:00.550
What are you
talking about, Grandpa?

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:02.970
You'll have to
become responsible.

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.760
You've got
a bumpy road ahead.

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:06.970
It's not my child.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:08.730
Oh, forget it.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:13.650
Tenchi, don't forget
practice this afternoon.

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:15.360
Tenchi.

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:17.110
Don't worry about him.

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:19.190
He's the serious type,
just like his mother.

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:23.410
Ryo-Ohki!

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:32.370
What is it, Ryo-Ohki?
Huh?

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:34.540
Ayeka.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.050
Hey, where are you going?

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:41.260
Ryo-Ohki!

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:44.720
What?

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.840
Ryo-Ohki.

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:20.550
Go away,
you dirty little thing!

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:27.300
Very well.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:29.180
I want you
to stay right there.

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:31.810
I'll be the one
to go away.

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:35.480
Don't you dare follow me.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:54.120
I said don't follow me.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:02.590
The royal teardrop?

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:08.510
No...

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:10.140
It can't be.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:12.980
It is the color
of your eyes.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:17.440
One day, I will be
your bride, won't l?

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:32.040
Leave me alone.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:36.250
Please leave me alone.

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:47.590
For me?

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:52.100
You funny little thing.

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:56.770
Don't you know
that I hate you?

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:07.650
Let's see.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:15.660
Just where would she
keep that sword?

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:17.620
Ah, Yosho!

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.330
Her brother...

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:22.040
Good riddance to him.

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:23.960
Ayeka, where are you?

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:25.840
This doesn't look good.

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.680
No, she isn't in here.

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:31.390
Where did everyone go to?

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:37.680
So, tell me,
what do I do now?

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:40.770
With my spaceship destroyed,...

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:44.110
I can neither fly, nor
communicate with my people.

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:48.030
The only clue I have
is the sword.

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:49.610
I wonder...

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.910
Could my brother
really be...

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:57.370
But you don't understand
a word I say.

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:00.830
What is it?

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.710
You'll get lost.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:07.880
Ryo-Ohki!

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:11.430
I can't find her anywhere.

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:23.810
Tenchi, watch your feet.

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:29.320
You still stink.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:31.820
Ouch.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:35.330
Now, let's start over
with the basic patterns.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:36.240
O.K.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:41.250
Ready?

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:42.250
Right.

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:45.420
That's...

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:50.220
That's just like...

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:53.010
The swordplay routines
of Jurai's Royal Family.

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:54.550
Yosho...

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:57.560
It may be a clue
to his whereabouts.

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:58.560
Tenchi.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:05.610
What's wrong, Tenchi?
you're a sitting duck.

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.980
Was that part
of the routine?

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:08.650
Nope.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:10.690
What was that?

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:12.950
Ouch.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:16.120
Why must I suffer
from this kind of disgrace?

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:20.250
What are you doing
down there?

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:21.410
Are you all right?

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.620
I'm sorry. I'm all right.

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:24.830
Ayeka.

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:26.380
I'm all right.

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:28.210
It hurts.

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:31.090
Red blood.

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:34.510
Ah, nothing.

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:37.470
What are you
doing there?

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:41.980
It looks like
a bad wound.

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:43.690
Sir...

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:47.270
That sword-play routine
you were performing...

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:50.900
Tenchi, carry this young
lady home on your back.

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:54.030
She'd better not be using
this foot for a while.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:57.870
Sir, did I say anything
to offend you?

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:00.790
I'll be on my way home.
You take care of her.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:03.120
Wait a minute, Grandpa.

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:13.720
Ryoko.

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:15.470
Ryoko.

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:17.340
It's raining.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.220
Stop the rain.

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:21.680
My sister and the others
are still outside.

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:26.310
On this planet, they don't have
a way of doing that yet.

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:28.360
Hey, Sasami,

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:32.940
Do you happen to know where
your sister keeps Tenchi's sword?

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:36.490
Um... she carries it with her
wherever she goes, I think.

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:37.610
Of course.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:57.180
Here, you can dry
yourself with this.

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:02.810
Well...

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:19.160
I guess I'll go outside
for a while.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:30.210
Tenchi, what do you
think you're doing?

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:01.490
What is it?

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:14.630
Ayeka, what's wrong?

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:18.260
Something... something
lunged at me.

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:26.220
Don't worry.

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:28.100
It's only Ryo-ohki.

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:28.810
Oh...

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:34.190
She scared the daylights
out of me,

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:35.940
The naughty thing.

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:41.200
Well...

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:46.280
I'm going back outside.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:50.500
Outside...

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.670
Outside must be cold.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:08.810
I guess I must have misunderstood
certain things.

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:11.730
Since you were with Ryoko,

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.980
I thought
you were her friend.

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.190
Well, I'm not,

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:18.480
But I think I started all
this by opening the gate.

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:19.320
The gate?

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:21.320
Near here there's a cave,

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:23.360
And Ryoko
was locked up in it.

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:25.240
My brother did that.

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:26.320
Yosho...

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:28.830
That's what the legend says.

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:35.420
Can I ask you
a question?

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:37.090
Oh... sure.

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:39.050
What are you
going to do now?

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:44.180
I know I cannot return
to my planet now.

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:47.260
I must continue the search
for my brother.

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:48.890
Only it's hard for me.

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:51.180
I have no relatives
on this alien planet.

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:55.520
Please stay with us
as long as you like.

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:59.650
I'm the one who's
responsible for all this.

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:03.780
And besides,
we're related, too, I guess.

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:07.620
Yosho is my half-brother.

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:11.580
You may think it odd
to marry your brother,

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:14.710
but even though my parents
arranged the engagement,

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:16.920
I was happy about it.

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:20.090
Just... just to think
that I won't be able

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:22.840
to share this feeling
with my brother,

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:24.010
I don't...

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:27.680
I don't know
what to do anymore.

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:29.050
His ship...

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:32.060
It must have been destroyed,
just like yours was.

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:35.350
That must be it.

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:37.690
And he was forced to...

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:41.530
Well, so, you should...

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:44.110
Cheer up!

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:47.160
You should cheer up!

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:56.540
What is it, huh?

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:58.170
Carrots?

00:21:58.250 --> 00:21:59.960
You want this carrot?

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:02.800
There... there.

00:22:04.630 --> 00:22:05.550
Here.

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:11.510
Carrots, eh?

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:14.980
I can't believe you'll grow up
to be a spaceship.

00:22:21.520 --> 00:22:23.780
Whew...
it finally cleared up.

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:28.030
Well, shall we go now?

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:43.750
Would you like
to go see Ryoko's cave?

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:46.300
We might just find a clue
there about your brother.

00:22:46.300 --> 00:22:48.170
Well, what is that?

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:51.800
Oh, that's the holy tree
of the Masaki shrine.

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:53.890
There are miracle stories
about it.

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:56.270
They say if you make a wish
on a full moon,...

00:22:56.310 --> 00:22:57.850
it will come true.

00:22:58.140 --> 00:22:59.560
Another story says...

00:22:59.560 --> 00:23:01.860
you can make rain
if you pray for it.

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:03.860
Would you like
to go see it?

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:15.290
There is no doubt.

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:17.830
This is Funaho.
It's alive.

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:19.290
Funaho?

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:21.170
My brother's spaceship.

00:23:21.170 --> 00:23:24.500
Remember there was a tree
exactly like this in my ship?

00:23:24.500 --> 00:23:27.550
This tree is the heart and soul
of the ship,

00:23:28.010 --> 00:23:31.010
Wow. This transforms into one of
those giant spaceships?

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:34.260
No, this one
has taken root.

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:36.260
It can't become
a spaceship.

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:46.070
Whoa! What's happening?

00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:47.820
The ship's memory.

00:23:49.490 --> 00:23:50.530
Memory?

00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:54.820
What's that?

00:23:56.490 --> 00:23:58.160
That's my brother's ship.

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:08.250
Ryoko.

00:24:08.590 --> 00:24:09.670
She looks scary.

00:24:10.550 --> 00:24:12.220
Is that Yosho?

00:24:23.600 --> 00:24:24.730
That lake.

00:24:24.730 --> 00:24:26.900
This must be
how it was made.

00:24:40.080 --> 00:24:42.910
He is alive,
I'm sure of it now.

00:24:42.910 --> 00:24:44.580
Since Funaho is alive,...

00:24:44.580 --> 00:24:47.710
somewhere on this planet,
Yosho must be alive also.

00:24:48.500 --> 00:24:50.000
I'm sorry.

00:24:50.000 --> 00:24:52.590
I've been so cold to you.

00:24:53.260 --> 00:24:55.010
I'll return this
to you.

00:24:55.010 --> 00:24:55.680
What?

00:24:56.010 --> 00:24:59.260
You are related by blood
to Jurai's Royal Family.

00:24:59.260 --> 00:25:01.220
I am asking you
to protect us

00:25:01.220 --> 00:25:03.640
Until my brother
is found.

00:25:05.100 --> 00:25:08.060
But I'm no good
at handling that sword.

00:25:10.820 --> 00:25:13.030
Ayeka!

00:25:13.860 --> 00:25:16.200
-Sasami.
-Where have you been

00:25:16.200 --> 00:25:18.780
You've been gone so long,
I was worried.

00:25:18.780 --> 00:25:19.700
I'm sorry.

00:25:19.700 --> 00:25:21.830
Did you come all this way
by yourself?

00:25:21.830 --> 00:25:24.160
No, Ryoko is with me,...

00:25:24.410 --> 00:25:26.580
and Ryo-Ohki
met us halfway.

00:25:26.580 --> 00:25:28.000
She brought us here.

00:25:29.590 --> 00:25:31.760
You are one
funny little creature.

00:25:33.010 --> 00:25:36.510
O.K., O.K.
What a friendly atmosphere.

00:25:37.010 --> 00:25:38.050
Ryoko.

00:25:40.970 --> 00:25:44.640
Tenchi, how come you've been with
this unworthy girl all the time?

00:25:44.640 --> 00:25:47.690
Because I had to.
Ayeka injured herself.

00:25:47.690 --> 00:25:51.650
You got the sword back!
Tenchi, well done, my boy.

00:25:52.070 --> 00:25:55.650
No. I returned the sword
to Tenchi.

00:25:55.860 --> 00:25:56.490
Huh?

00:26:00.530 --> 00:26:05.410
O.K., so you're pissed
we got it back.

00:26:05.830 --> 00:26:07.210
But it's true.

00:26:07.330 --> 00:26:10.790
Tenchi and I
are related by blood.

00:26:10.840 --> 00:26:13.340
It's really
none of your business.

00:26:15.170 --> 00:26:16.970
None of my business!?

00:26:17.680 --> 00:26:20.300
I came all this way
just to help you.

00:26:20.300 --> 00:26:23.100
All right then,
do what you want.

00:26:24.970 --> 00:26:26.810
Ryoko.

00:26:26.810 --> 00:26:28.310
To help us?

00:26:29.190 --> 00:26:30.940
Hey, Ryoko,

00:26:30.940 --> 00:26:32.690
It's all
a misunderstanding.

00:26:32.690 --> 00:26:35.070
We didn't mean any harm.

00:26:35.070 --> 00:26:36.900
Forget it, let's go.

00:26:36.900 --> 00:26:40.280
But you never know what she's
going to do when she gets upset.

00:26:40.820 --> 00:26:45.410
Oh, I thought you were
going to protect me.

00:26:45.410 --> 00:26:47.160
Let's go, Tenchi.

00:26:49.210 --> 00:26:50.380
Come now.

00:29:11.100 --> 00:29:12.430
PREVIEW OF NEXT EPISODE

00:29:12.430 --> 00:29:12.810
Hello! We're at a hot
spring in Okayama.
PREVIEW OF NEXT EPISODE

00:29:12.810 --> 00:29:16.770
Hello! We're at a hot
spring in Okayama.

00:29:16.770 --> 00:29:19.270
While we're getting
to know each other,...

00:29:19.270 --> 00:29:21.030
another guest appears.

00:29:21.030 --> 00:29:24.070
That's Galaxy Police, Mihoshi.

00:29:24.070 --> 00:29:26.240
She's after the most wanted...

00:29:26.240 --> 00:29:29.030
and nefarious criminal
in the universe.

00:29:29.030 --> 00:29:30.660
All the way to Earth.

00:29:30.660 --> 00:29:32.370
I'm scared.

00:29:33.120 --> 00:29:37.500
Tenchi Muyo episode#4
MIHOSHI FALLS TO THE LAND OF STARS

00:29:37.500 --> 00:29:37.830
A long falling night
is mysterious.

00:29:37.830 --> 00:29:40.590
